OL,3,GNEWSACould rebel knight Roger Casement
OL,4,Abe exhumed for a second time?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn application has been lodged to have
OL,7,Fthe remains of a knight of the realm
OL,8,Fturned Easter Rising conspirator, Roger
OL,9,FCasement, moved to Northern Ireland.
OL,11,FIf successful, it would be the second
OL,12,Ftime Casement will have been exhumed
OL,13,Fand reburied.
OL,15,FCasement was originally interred in the
OL,16,Fgrounds of Pentonville Prison in
OL,17,FLondon, where he was hanged in 1916
OL,18,Fafter being discovered returning to
OL,19,FIreland aboard a U-boat following a
OL,20,Ftrip to Germany to secure arms for
OL,21,FIrish nationalists.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
